 prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and January to February came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle hit 143% of normal in August to September but only 41% in January to February. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 28% of normal on the middle. Grid 27121 had its driest year in 1989 at 47%.</p>"}
